    "kind": "struct_field",
    "signature": "newline_delimited: bool",
    "docs": "The JSON format to use when reading files.\n\nWhen `true` (default), expects newline-delimited JSON (NDJSON):\n```text\n{\"key1\": 1, \"key2\": \"val\"}\n{\"key1\": 2, \"key2\": \"vals\"}\n```\n\nWhen `false`, expects JSON array format:\n```text\n[\n  {\"key1\": 1, \"key2\": \"val\"},\n  {\"key1\": 2, \"key2\": \"vals\"}\n]\n```",
